[{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0353","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0353.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53008","title":"Linux Kernel CIFS 会话设置内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 CIFS 文件系统客户端在会话初始化过程中存在内存泄漏漏洞，由于 `cifs_ses::auth_key.response` 在重新分配前未正确释放，导致在重连或挂载操作时发生内存泄露。本地低权限攻击者可利用该漏洞反复触发会话重建，耗尽系统内存资源，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 2.6.37 至 6.1.8 版本及 6.2 候选版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。Linux 内核社区已在 6.1.9 及后续稳定版本中修复此漏洞。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53008"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:06Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至包含 commit 4ce341b4b8e7（cifs: fix potential memory leaks in session setup）的版本（如 6.6 及以上稳定版），或应用对应发行版（RHEL/Ubuntu/Debian）提供的安全补丁。无法立即更新的情况下，可禁用 SMB1 协议（在 /etc/samba/smb.conf 中设置 min protocol = SMB2）以减少攻击面。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2fe58d977ee05da5bb89ef5dc4f5bf2dc15db46f","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/893d45394dbe4b5cbf3723c19e2ccc8b93a6ac9b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53008.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53008.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ee0faf64b77ff7a5d60107543287bfbcf4a3c8bf/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53008.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-53008","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53008.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53008.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-wpc3-48hj-vqgf/GHSA-wpc3-48hj-vqgf.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53008","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2023-53008.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53008.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0353.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0352","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0352.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53002","title":"Linux kernel drm/i915 内存泄漏漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 drm/i915 驱动中 `mmap_offset` 重复使用导致内存泄漏，`drm_vma_node_allow()` 与 `drm_vma_node_revoke()` 调用未成对平衡，每次用户调用 `mmap_offset` 时调用前者但后者仅在释放时调用一次，导致每文件 `vm_count` 非零且红黑树节点泄漏。本地攻击者可通过反复触发 `mmap_offset` 操作耗尽系统内存，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 主线内核版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53002"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:49Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:05Z","remediation":"立即升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.9 及以上版本（含 6.2+），或合入修复补丁 commits `0bdc4b4ba720` / `0220e4fe178c`（均位于 `drivers/gpu/drm/i915/gem/i915_gem_mman.c`）。若无法立即升级，可通过限制本地用户对 i915 DRM 设备的访问权限作为临时缓解措施，或在内核启动参数中禁用 i915 模块（`modprobe.blacklist=i915`）以完全规避此内存泄漏风险。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0220e4fe178c3390eb0291cdb34912d66972db8a","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/0bdc4b4ba7206c452ee81c82fa66e39d0e1780fb","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53002.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53002.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ee0faf64b77ff7a5d60107543287bfbcf4a3c8bf/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53002.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-53002","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53002.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53002.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-vxj7-p6gh-99vg/GHSA-vxj7-p6gh-99vg.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-53002","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2023-53002.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-53002.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0352.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0351","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0351.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53001","title":"Linux 内核 DRM VMA Manager 安全漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 DRM（Direct Rendering Manager）子系统的 VMA（Virtual Memory Area）管理器中存在内存泄漏漏洞（CWE-401）。drm_vma_node_allow_once() 函数在多次调用 drm_vma_node_allow() 时缺乏引用计数与去重机制，导致内核内存资源无法被正确释放，产生内存泄漏。本地攻击者在具备低权限（需要可访问 DRM 设备的权限）的条件下，通过反复发起涉及 DRM VMA 节点操作的 ioctl 调用，可逐步耗尽系统内核内存，触发可用内存不足，最终导致系统拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核 6.1.9 之前版本及 6.2-rc1 至 rc5 版本，CVSS v3.1 评分 5.5，危害等级中危。该 CVE 编号后续已被 CVE Numbering Authority（kernel.org）拒绝/撤销。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53001"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:48Z","updated":"2025-07-15T16:15:24Z","remediation":"将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.9 及以上版本，或 6.2-rc6 及以上版本。如使用发行版内核（如 Ubuntu/Debian/RHEL），安装对应内核安全更新即可修复。该修复通过提交 899d3a3c19ac（主线）和 67444f8ca31c（稳定分支）合入，添加了 drm_vma_node_allow_once() 接口以防止 VMA 节点引用计数泄漏导致的内存耗尽。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53001.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-53001","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-53001.json","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2023-53001.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-mq3c-v59w-hjf6/GHSA-mq3c-v59w-hjf6.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-53001","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c34402aaa65883c51c1d03b3cb02c20cb/2023/CVE-2023-53001.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--3a053ff6-b3a0-40a7-818d-8074a272f06a.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53001.json","https://github.com/openharmony/security/blob/f47b282130050082f1bcf6813aaced4157bd1771/zh/security-disclosure/2025/2025-09.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0351.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0350","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0350.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52981","title":"Linux drm/i915 错误捕获与调试文件系统转储引用计数漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 drm/i915 显卡驱动在错误捕获（error capture）和 debugfs 调试文件系统转储功能中存在引用计数缺陷。当 GuC 提交（submission）支持被加入错误捕获后，请求对象（request object）的引用计数机制被破坏：基于上下文的搜索与基于 execlist 的请求搜索使用了不同的锁机制和引用计数需求，未能正确处理。本地攻击者可通过触发 GPU 错误捕获或读取 debugfs 调试转储来利用此漏洞，可能导致释放后使用（Use-After-Free）或空指针解引用等内存安全问题。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52981"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:45Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:02Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至 6.1.12+ 或 6.2+ 版本，该修复已合入主线 commit 3700e353781e。如无法升级内核，可临时禁用 GuC submission（模块参数 i915.enable_guc=0）作为缓解措施，但建议尽快完成内核更新以彻底修复引用计数缺陷。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/86d8ddc74124c3fdfc139f246ba6da15e45e86e3","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/9467397f417dd7b5d0db91452f0474e79716a527","https://nvd.nist.gov/vuln/detail/CVE-2023-52981"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0350.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0349","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0349.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52979","title":"Linux Kernel squashfs 扩展属性标识表读取合理性检查绕过漏洞","description":"该 CVE 编号已被分配机构拒绝/撤销，当前状态为无效。原申报内容涉及 Linux 内核 squashfs 文件系统驱动中 squashfs_read_xattr_id_table 函数的健全性检查增强，旨在修复读取扩展属性（xattr）ID 表时可能存在的内存越界访问问题。由于该 issue 被确认不构成安全漏洞或属于重复编号，CVE 编号已被正式撤销，不适用于实际漏洞场景的利用或修复。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52979"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:45Z","updated":"2025-10-07T07:15:37Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至以下修复版本：4.14.306、4.19.273、5.4.232、5.10.168、5.15.93 或 6.1.11 及以上版本。对应修复提交为 de2785aa3448（v6.1.11）、cf5d66120924（v5.15.93）、db76fc535fbd（v5.10.168）等。如无法立即升级内核，可通过禁用 SquashFS 文件系统挂载作为临时缓解措施，或在挂载时使用 `no_xattr` 选项禁止扩展属性处理以避免触发漏洞路径。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52979.json","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ee0faf64b77ff7a5d60107543287bfbcf4a3c8bf/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52979.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-52979","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2023-52979.md","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2023-52979-squashfs-harden-sanity-check-in-squ-1771405583000.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-52979.json","https://github.com/GingaShift/Anssi-Vulnerability-Intelligence/blob/5e1cffb341ca5a500e965d4cda39bf8603e2ff16/data/offline_prof/first/CVE-2023-52979","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/8575b52c5f0d68ec89781aae82e849b4f469cd84/CVE/data/2023/CVE-2023-52979.json","https://github.com/oasis-open/cti-stix-common-objects/blob/55ba7598cbd5a52577b6887871505d931d85cb61/objects/vulnerability/vulnerability--c7917e8b-1963-4399-a2a9-99597c32f471.json","https://github.com/begumsozer/Atelier_Data_Project/blob/c180b70b99084444dad46b49963b14f4cf496528/cve_ids.txt"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0349.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0345","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0345.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52939","title":"Linux Kernel 内存 cgroup 脏页回写跟踪空指针解引用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核内存控制组（memcg）子系统中存在空指针解引用漏洞。当硬件中毒（hwpoison）机制强制将 LRU 中毒页面注销时，folio_memcg 变为 NULL，导致 mem_cgroup_track_foreign_dirty_slowpath() 函数在执行脏页回写跟踪时出现空指针解引用，进而触发内核崩溃。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核各版本，CVSS 评分 5.5，危害等级中等。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52939"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:43:58Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit `mem_cgroup_track_foreign_dirty()` 中增加 `folio_memcg` 空指针检查的稳定版本（如 6.1.x/6.6.x LTS 系列对应修复版本），或应用对应发行版内核安全补丁。如无法立即更新，可通过内核参数 `cgroup.memory=nokmem` 禁用内核内存计量作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/ac86f547ca1002aec2ef66b9e64d03f45bbbfbb9","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/b79ba5953f6fdc5559389ad415620bffc24f024b","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52939.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-52939.yaml","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ecab81d7d04fc29e521ba40362078f57ea679e40/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52939.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-52939","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-52939.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-52939.json","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-p579-25jc-wxr5/GHSA-p579-25jc-wxr5.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-52939","https://github.com/AwwMann99/VulneRAG/blob/09adf154d3574ffded6af925a6311b0a20df9db0/docs/Cve_Data/cve_md/CVE-2023-52939.md","https://github.com/Patrowl/PatrowlHearsData/blob/9c3559b25784ca21f930998243369aaa64d45e45/SSVC/data/2023/CVE-2023-52939.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0345.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0344","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0344.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52935","title":"Linux Kernel mm/khugepaged 匿名映射 VMA 竞争条件导致释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 mm/khugepaged 子系统存在条件竞争漏洞，由于 collapse_and_free_pmd() 函数在释放页表时未正确持有 anon_vma 锁，本地攻击者可通过竞态条件合并相邻 VMA 的 anon_vma（与子进程共享），导致并发 rmap 遍历访问正在被释放的页表，进而触发 use-after-free 和锁依赖警告。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高，本地低权限用户可利用此漏洞实现权限提升或系统崩溃。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52935"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-27T17:15:43Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:43:58Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至以下已修复版本：5.4.299+、5.10.243+、5.15.192+、6.1.11+ 或 6.2+。修复提交为 mm/khugepaged 中在持有 mmap 锁后重复检查 ->anon_vma，防止折叠页表时的释放后使用竞争条件。对于无法立即升级的系统，可通过内核命令行参数 `transparent_hugepage=never` 禁用透明 hugepage 作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/023f47a8250c6bdb4aebe744db4bf7f73414028b","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/352fbf61ce776fef18dca6a68680a6cd943dac95","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/abdf3c33918185c3e8ffeb09ed3e334b3d7df47c","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/acb08187b5a83cdb9ac4112fae9e18cf983b0128","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/cee956ab1efbd858b4ca61c8b474af5aa24b29a6","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/10/msg00007.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-52935.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52935.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-52935.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-52935","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ecab81d7d04fc29e521ba40362078f57ea679e40/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52935.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-52935.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2023-52935-2025-11-03-1136","https://github.com/mabitoski/cve_submodules/blob/44ad7e2705b3aef1b2ffaf64bd47596c10a6c2e4/2023/CVE-2023-52935.md","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-whcm-px77-62x7/GHSA-whcm-px77-62x7.json","https://github.com/TonneauBenjamin/ANSSI_Project/blob/f0e2d5e8be75f0351e759642d04d728399b4faa9/data/raw/first/CVE-2023-52935"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0344.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0356","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0356.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-53012","title":"Linux 内核 thermal 子系统设备注册引用计数错误漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 thermal 核心模块在 __thermal_cooling_device_register() 函数中存在设备引用计数使用不当缺陷，put_device() 在 device_register() 失败前被错误调用，且在部分错误路径上不必要地调用了 thermal_cooling_device_destroy_sysfs()。本地攻击者可利用此缺陷触发内核对象错误释放，导致系统崩溃或拒绝服务。该漏洞 CVSS 评分 5.5，攻击者需本地低权限访问，无需用户交互。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.5,"aliases":["CVE-2023-53012"],"sources":["cve"],"published":"2025-03-27T00:00:00Z","updated":"2026-06-17T00:00:00Z","remediation":"更新 Linux 内核至修复版本：5.15.x 系列升级至 5.16 及以上，6.0.x 系列升级至 6.1 及以上，6.1.x 系列升级至 6.2 及以上。补丁已合入内核主线仓库，可通过 git 拉取 commit a7d736cc3c6c、2846a7412f62 或 6c54b7bc8a31 应用修复。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/2846a7412f6246fd5171f51011bf76dfebcec0ee","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6c54b7bc8a31ce0f7cc7f8deef05067df414f1d8","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a7d736cc3c6cb0d7498bbfb56515d414e35e9510","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/53xxx/CVE-2023-53012.json","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-53012.yaml","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-53012.md","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-53012.json","https://github.com/openbmc/openbmc/blob/0478d501e9e2b8c9215e795c9b359dead7f96d9a/upstream-layers/openembedded-core/meta/recipes-kernel/linux/cve-exclusion.inc","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/active/CVE-2023-53012","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-53012.json","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-53012.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-pqmw-jx87-8vxx/GHSA-pqmw-jx87-8vxx.json","https://github.com/nomi-sec/NVD-Database/blob/23dc120c20cb/2023/CVE-2023-53012.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0356.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0343","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0343.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52927","title":"Linux Kernel netfilter 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 netfilter 子系统中 nf_ct_find_expectation() 函数存在释放后使用漏洞。当该函数调用时会从哈希表中移除连接追踪期望条目，但在 OVS（Open vSwitch）和 TC（流量控制）等场景中，新创建连接追踪条目可能未被确认，导致已释放的期望条目被再次访问，从而触发释放后使用。本地攻击者可利用此漏洞导致系统崩溃或权限提升，影响多个 Linux 内核版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高危。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52927"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-14T15:15:39Z","updated":"2026-07-14T13:17:05Z","remediation":"立即将 Linux 内核升级至 6.1.130 或更高版本（稳定分支）或 6.6 及以上版本，对应修复 commit 为 4914109a8e1e。Debian 11 用户请安装 2025 年 5 月 LTS 安全更新。Siemens SIMATIC S7-1500 MFP 用户请参考西门子安全公告 SSA-019113/SSA-082556 升级固件。无法立即更新的场景可考虑禁用 OVS/TC conntrack 相关功能作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/3fa58a6fbd1e9e5682d09cdafb08fba004cb12ec","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/4914109a8e1e494c6aa9852f9e84ec77a5fc643f","https://seadragnol.github.io/posts/CVE-2023-52927/","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00045.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-019113.html","https://cert-portal.siemens.com/productcert/html/ssa-082556.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-52927.md","https://github.com/nomi-sec/PoC-in-GitHub/blob/e28e8e8f0aba9e30b308efdfe0fc8edb9994cc08/2023/CVE-2023-52927.json","https://github.com/google/security-research/blob/8a0aff9876ee9d12dcc2ec49453e76c8e0cf51b2/pocs/linux/kernelctf/CVE-2023-52927_cos/docs/vulnerability.md","https://github.com/arschlochnop/VulnWatchdog/blob/44b0a0fafad6918410a84d4e8b54974323124158/data/2023/CVE-2023-52927-seadragnol_CVE-2023-52927.md","https://github.com/rix4uni/cvemapping/blob/dc4a87067238e8e55e5d3f9777b54558310f6d6e/2023/CVE-2023-52927/README.md","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-52927.yaml","https://github.com/SEC-bench/SEC-bench-Pro/blob/6bb682fcf169664234f8e9c87de675d61b822f73/projects/linux/CVE-2023-52927/VERIFIED.txt","https://github.com/sari3l/Poc-Monitor/blob/e6a2c88657ae90cd7ad32328e40c3e9d3c5f5451/2023/CVE-2023-52927.json","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-52927","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest/blob/0a049aa092a2797f930b44155f6f1b4d78c9e2d7/references/contrib1-CveServices-CVE-2023-52927-2025-11-03-1325","https://github.com/seadragnol/CVE-2023-52927","https://github.com/HoangNhoo/Reproduce-CVE-2023-52927"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0343.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0348","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0348.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52971","title":"MariaDB Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MariaDB Server 在 JOIN::fix_all_splittings_in_plan 函数中存在缺陷，远程攻击者可通过构造特制的 SQL 查询语句触发该函数中的异常处理错误，导致 MariaDB 服务进程崩溃，造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 MariaDB 10.10 至 10.11.* 以及 11.0 至 11.4.* 系列版本，攻击者无需高权限即可利用，CVSS 评分 4.9，危害等级中等。建议用户升级至已修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52971"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-08T23:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:01Z","remediation":"升级 MariaDB Server 至 10.11.12 及以上版本、11.4.6 及以上版本或 11.8.2 及以上版本。该漏洞已在对应修复版本中通过优化器改造解决，建议立即从 mariadb.org 下载更新或通过系统包管理器升级。如无法立即升级，可在应用层避免执行包含子查询左连接的复杂 SQL 语句作为临时缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-32084","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/0e6d432d517e5cdf9829125ecfaa3a6437985a0c/cves/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52971.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-52971.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-52971","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ee0faf64b77ff7a5d60107543287bfbcf4a3c8bf/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52971.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-52971.md","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2025/mariadb/gb_mariadb_CVE-2023-52971.nasl","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-52971.html","https://github.com/github/advisory-database/blob/a96652a2a06e880f217d1d6526622d8501dbbd69/advisories/unreviewed/2025/03/GHSA-j57w-cc2h-3w6w/GHSA-j57w-cc2h-3w6w.json","https://github.com/SatelliteQE/robottelo/blob/de607c0416a7a4f8b458c2ca65a271d12a173f8b/robottelo/constants/__init__.py","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/02/18/seguranca/cve-2023-52971-mariadb-server-1010-through-1011-an-1771408503000.md"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0348.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0347","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0347.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52970","title":"MariaDB Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MariaDB Server 在 `Item_direct_view_ref::derived_field_transformer_for_where` 函数中存在处理缺陷，当执行包含派生视图引用的特制 SQL 查询时，可触发服务进程崩溃。该漏洞影响 MariaDB Server 10.4 至 11.4 系列的多个版本，攻击者可通过向数据库服务器发送精心构造的查询语句导致拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 4.9，危害等级中等，建议用户升级至已修复版本。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52970"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-08T23:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:01Z","remediation":"升级 MariaDB Server 至 10.5.29、10.6.22、10.11.12、11.4.6 或 11.8.2 及以上版本，即可修复该崩溃问题。如无法立即升级，可在会话中设置 `SET SESSION optimizer_switch='condition_pushdown_for_derived=off'` 临时禁用派生表条件下推优化作为缓解措施。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-32086","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00006.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52970.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-52970.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-52970","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ee0faf64b77ff7a5d60107543287bfbcf4a3c8bf/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52970.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-52970.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-52970.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2025/mariadb/gb_mariadb_CVE-2023-52970.nasl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2023-52970-2025-11-03-1350","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/02/seguranca/cve-2023-52970-mariadb-server-104-through-105-106--1767404169000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-52970.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0347.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0346","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0346.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52969","title":"MariaDB MariaDB Server 拒绝服务漏洞","description":"MariaDB Server 在查询优化阶段存在缺陷，当处理特制 SQL 查询时，make_aggr_tables_info 与 optimize_stage2 函数中的异常会导致服务器崩溃且无法生成回溯日志。该漏洞影响 10.4 至 11.0 等多个版本系列，具有数据库操作权限的攻击者可通过构造恶意查询触发此问题，造成拒绝服务。CVSS 评分 4.9，危害等级中危。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":4.9,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52969"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-03-08T23:15:14Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:44:01Z","remediation":"升级 MariaDB Server 至修复版本：10.5.x 升级到 ≥10.5.29，10.6.x 升级到 ≥10.6.22，10.11.x 升级到 ≥10.11.12，11.0.x 迁移至 11.4.6 或 11.8.2 及以上。如无法立即升级，可在应用层避免执行目标表出现在 SELECT 子查询中的 INSERT...SELECT 语句作为临时缓解。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://jira.mariadb.org/browse/MDEV-32083","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/05/msg00006.html","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52969.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/935010a28fdab6bbd2dc347ebc953db9773080d4/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-52969.json","https://github.com/neuvector/vul-source/blob/27dcc23268ea595c1e22ac2008b340bb4e848cb2/ubuntu-cve-tracker/retired/CVE-2023-52969","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ee0faf64b77ff7a5d60107543287bfbcf4a3c8bf/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52969.json","https://github.com/yarencheng/cve-devops-playground/blob/cbe73d6bdcced13ea57f08566d6bbf5345864f7e/content/CVE-2023-52969.md","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/ee84993ad655ae5f90f9948f27d13851ad8b9fd3/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-52969.json","https://github.com/jbeasl7/openvas-feed-sync-local/blob/0ca27158e3313c25f9fa1fe358be43c227fdedbe/openvas-feeds/nvt-feed/2025/mariadb/gb_mariadb_CVE-2023-52969.nasl","https://github.com/CVEProject/cve-reference-ingest-data/blob/54ab2d6e8edcc52192915a067c45b2190f568993/references/CveServices-CVE-2023-52969-2025-11-03-1350","https://github.com/joaop9425/manual-do-tecnico/blob/cc6e0f5304777f18e55db554da5372bc31d4cae1/src/content/noticias/2026/01/02/seguranca/cve-2023-52969-mariadb-server-104-through-105-106--1767404181000.md","https://github.com/Hashmire/cpeApplicabilityGeneratorPages/blob/4588dccb1f913705444975eb2a5eb79962bf2513/generated_pages/CVE-2023-52969.html"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0346.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0342","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0342.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-52926","title":"Linux Kernel io_uring 释放后使用漏洞","description":"Linux 内核 io_uring 子系统中的 IORING_OP_READ 操作在处理读取 I/O 返回负值（除 -EAGAIN 和 -EIOCBQUEUED 外）时未正确释放已提供的缓冲区列表，导致在 io_rw_done 完成回调运行于不同上下文时触发释放后使用（Use-After-Free）漏洞。本地攻击者可通过构造特制的 io_uring 请求序列利用此漏洞实现权限提升。该漏洞影响 Linux 内核多个版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-52926"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2025-02-24T09:15:09Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:43:56Z","remediation":"升级 Linux 内核至包含 commit 22d57f2a2e48 (\"io_uring/rw: split io_read() into a helper\") 的版本，对应主线内核 v6.2+、长期支持分支 v6.1.8+ 或发行版已合入该补丁的内核包。如无法立即升级，可在启动参数中添加 `io_uring.disable=1` 禁用 io_uring 子系统作为临时缓解措施（仅限非 io_uring 依赖环境）。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/6c27fc6a783c8a77c756dd5461b15e465020d075","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/72060434a14caea20925e492310d6e680e3f9007","https://git.kernel.org/stable/c/a08d195b586a217d76b42062f88f375a3eedda4d","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2025/03/msg00001.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-52926.md","https://github.com/google/security-research/blob/8a0aff9876ee9d12dcc2ec49453e76c8e0cf51b2/pocs/linux/kernelctf/CVE-2023-52926_lts/metadata.json","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/837e8232e5e0f859088f714711fc711909aefe8c/cves/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52926.json","https://github.com/xairy/linux-kernel-exploitation/blob/1120e9cea80c6039b8c8151bde6067c2cd76daa4/README.md","https://github.com/SEC-bench/SEC-bench-Pro/blob/6bb682fcf169664234f8e9c87de675d61b822f73/projects/linux/CVE-2023-52926/VERIFIED.txt","https://github.com/NUS-Curiosity/KernJC/blob/798845a541a5396395c7e0c1670cb4872dac7105/db/vuln_desc/2023/CVE-2023-52926.yaml","https://github.com/imSkows/Cyber-Vulnerability-Analysis-Data/blob/db26c44c5f45c25514223a46675daec7eea03092/data/first/CVE-2023-52926","https://github.com/peass-ng/PEASS-ng/blob/1cabd84639d48c21ba088e07e52661c30c906aef/linPEAS/builder/linpeas_parts/variables/kernel_cve_registry_data.sh","https://github.com/cisagov/vulnrichment/blob/ecab81d7d04fc29e521ba40362078f57ea679e40/2023/52xxx/CVE-2023-52926.json","https://github.com/bell-sw/osv-database/blob/822347fd3caaf420e746ba3d94262f4565fb6006/BELL-CVE/BELL-CVE-2023-52926.json"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0342.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0033","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0033.toml","cve_id":"无","title":"赛博龙 CROS 10.6.6 MR-5 安全漏洞","description":"Cyberoam CROS（Cyberoam Operating System）10.6.6 MR-5 版本存在一个未明确分类的安全漏洞。赛博龙（Cyberoam）统一威胁管理（UTM）设备运行的操作系统 CROS 在处理特定网络请求时可能存在安全缺陷，远程攻击者可能利用该漏洞导致设备服务异常或未授权访问。由于原始数据中未明确漏洞具体类型（标记为未知），建议关注厂商 Sophos 的安全公告并及时更新固件至最新版本。该漏洞影响运行 CROS 10.6.6 MR-5 版本的 Cyberoam 系列设备。","severity":"MEDIUM","score":5.0,"aliases":["HWPOC-2023-00da054d"],"sources":["hwpoc"],"published":"2024-08-09T00:00:00Z","updated":"2024-08-09T00:00:00Z","remediation":"升级 CROS 操作系统到最新支持的版本，建议升级至 CROS 10.7.x 或更高版本。同时，建议禁用不必要的服务，限制网络访问权限，并定期监控系统日志以发现异常活动。如需进一步信息，请查阅 Sophos 官方安全公告。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-14T00:00:00Z","references":["https://www.sophos.com/en-us/security-advisories"],"poc_urls":[],"exp_urls":[],"repo_poc_urls":[],"repo_exp_urls":[],"has_poc":false,"has_exp":false,"raw_url":"https://github.com/adysec/AVE/blob/main/vulns/2023/AVE-2023-0033.toml"},{"ave_id":"AVE-2023-0414","file_name":"2023/AVE-2023-0414.toml","cve_id":"CVE-2023-6175","title":"Wireshark NetScreen文件解析器缓冲区溢出漏洞","description":"Wireshark 的 NetScreen 文件解析器存在经典缓冲区溢出漏洞（CWE-120），攻击者可通过向受害者发送特制的捕获文件触发该漏洞，导致解析器崩溃从而造成拒绝服务。该漏洞影响 Wireshark 4.0.0 至 4.0.10 以及 3.6.0 至 3.6.18 版本，CVSS 评分 7.8，危害等级高。用户只需在 Wireshark 中打开恶意构造的捕获文件即可触发，无需额外权限。","severity":"HIGH","score":7.8,"aliases":["CVE-2023-6175"],"sources":["msrc"],"published":"2024-03-26T08:15:35Z","updated":"2026-06-17T06:50:14Z","remediation":"升级 Wireshark 至 4.0.11 及以上版本，或 3.6.19 及以上版本。如无法立即升级，可在「分析→已启用的协议」中禁用 NetScreen 协议解析器作为临时缓解措施，避免解析恶意构造的捕获文件。","status":"completed","collected_at":"2026-07-22T00:00:00Z","references":["https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/issues/19404","https://www.wireshark.org/security/wnpa-sec-2023-29.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2024/02/msg00016.html","https://lists.debian.org/debian-lts-announce/2024/09/msg00049.html","https://github.com/trickest/cve/blob/3ffa2a96db84a89f71e1c7ad889e5f4fcc755a48/2023/CVE-2023-6175.md","https://github.com/CVEProject/cvelistV5/blob/a54ce91ca4eed5acb1176739213f8ac035b9fa27/cves/2023/6xxx/CVE-2023-6175.json","https://github.com/canonical/ubuntu-security-notices/blob/fd5a60b9d722f22d25e3006c20222fbaba7000b5/osv/cve/2023/UBUNTU-CVE-2023-6175.json","https://github.com/kees/ubuntu-cve-tracker/blob/66a43c37da527bc16621fb5548dca8aa1f46e537/active/CVE-2023-6175","https:/